  "bindings": [
    "Compile original wildcard C and Swift ignore compiler, pattern pool and layered snapshot implementation.",
    "Use original root-authority construction over supplied control-file contents; filesystem acquisition, root ownership and revalidation are separate dependencies.",
    "Only package/public visibility and unused package imports are removed for the isolated reference executable. Production DEBUG metrics are not policy and are omitted from the port.",
